": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491818938_1099709932374440_3041211310705972345_n.png?_nc_cat=111&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=nxbLackHpXUQ7kNvwES9ZXX&_nc_oc=Adpgi6ycHoy7twE7yWIPWIVrirhySNnDZ2iGTyVv5ZQvMBOROJamcpPb7TizJto6vgM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQQkNcS3DGQo9ca8caRZ6Gy5j87EKQ4A8fZXKlJJpN-1w&oe=6AFF1C6D"}, {"file_name": "ScreenShot-04.png", "id": "1337318304800710", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491820585_1337318311467376_159200751625933356_n.png?_nc_cat=100&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=w32m-PIgMTMQ7kNvwFhw8R0&_nc_oc=AdpyM8T8AvOjEqbwV4AWKn8ld7i2cqfj-gqzY0-GJ_PcYWvWE2R263qoZviuEyz7Kiw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQTiiSEFOypLoze8V-WfK9FZ5_pZ5YrK6AtKrKMPHjY42A&oe=6AFF0F9C"}, {"file_name": "ScreenShot-05.png", "id": "682680914850733", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823876_682680918184066_4843740821197245477_n.png?_nc_cat=100&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=2xfiupUUHqsQ7kNvwFFmOQM&_nc_oc=Adrr0XecW3im9xoA21mGyewTYaPrA0LQNBLezO44086siN6Frg-MG00hxxTXYQoQVUY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQM2reDd1UQUO4BiwUuJYa-R-EMUWOAakhVAGv5GRZw5g&oe=6AFF11CD"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Cover Art Landscape 2560x1440-01.png", "id": "1435446094217683", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491824592_1435446097551016_1067909250866758337_n.png?_nc_cat=100&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=xAtV9hsmaE8Q7kNvwE6aVPZ&_nc_oc=AdqpArQO-4N-y2F30qJ5kAXAM-n1VlfiA9lZSNSxAWAp4SdN7kHs-NOJTykbpKHJklM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQS3w8HwlxG0Wms9ljXi5xKyWfhtDocEPmG7o-vRHhe9Dw&oe=6AFF1867"}, "display_name": "Safe Driving", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Have you ever wondered how you would react behind the wheel in critical situations?\nPicture this: you\u2019re driving at night\u2014tired, distracted, or after a few drinks\u2014and suddenly everything changes. Would you be able to stay in control of the vehicle? At Four Players VR, we\u2019ve created a driving simulation in Virtual Reality that allows you to safely and powerfully experience how alcohol, fatigue, and distractions affect your reflexes, attention, and decision-making.\n\nGet ready to drive with awareness:\n\n\ud83d\ude97 Experience: Discover firsthand the effects of alcohol, drowsiness, and cell phone use on your reaction time.\n\n\ud83d\ude97 Live: Realistic scenarios that show you the risks of driving under dangerous conditions.\n\n\ud83d\ude97 Learn: Turn every immersive experience into a practical lesson to promote safer, more responsible driving.\n\nDon\u2019t leave your safety to chance. Join us and transform the way you drive with Four Players VR! \ud83d\udea6", "short_description": "\ud83d\ude97 Experience: Feel how alcohol, fatigue, and distractions affect your attention and reflexes behind the wheel.\n\n\ud83d\ude97 Live: Immersive Virtual Reality scenarios that realistically show you the risks of irresponsible driving.\n\n\ud83d\ude97 Learn: Turn the experience into awareness\u2014perfect for training, campaigns, and educational programs."}, {"images": {"nodes": []}, "id": "1398165785463844", "locale": "es_LA", "screenshots": [], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Manejo Responsable", "keywords": [], "long_description": "\u00bfTe has preguntado alguna vez c\u00f3mo reaccion\u00e1s al volante en situaciones cr\u00edticas?\nImagin\u00e1 esto: est\u00e1s conduciendo de noche, cansado, distra\u00eddo o despu\u00e9s de unas copas, y de repente todo cambia. \u00bfPodr\u00edas mantener el control del veh\u00edculo? En Four Players VR, hemos creado una simulaci\u00f3n de conducci\u00f3n en Realidad Virtual que te permite experimentar, de forma segura e impactante, c\u00f3mo el alcohol, el cansancio y las distracciones afectan tus reflejos, tu atenci\u00f3n y tus decisiones.\n\nPrep\u00e1rate para conducir con conciencia:\n\n\ud83d\ude97 Experiment\u00e1: Descubr\u00ed en primera persona los efectos del alcohol, el sue\u00f1o y el celular en tu capacidad de reacci\u00f3n.\n\n\ud83d\ude97 Viv\u00ed: Situaciones realistas que te muestran los riesgos de manejar bajo condiciones peligrosas.\n\n\ud83d\ude97 Aprend\u00e9: Convert\u00ed cada experiencia inmersiva en una lecci\u00f3n pr\u00e1ctica para fomentar una conducci\u00f3n m\u00e1s segura y responsable.\n\nNo dejes tu seguridad al azar. \u00a1Unite a nosotros y transform\u00e1 tu manera de manejar con Four Players VR! \ud83d\udea6", "short_description": "\ud83d\ude97 Experiment\u00e1: Sent\u00ed c\u00f3mo el alcohol, el cansancio y las distracciones afectan tu atenci\u00f3n y reflejos al volante.\n\n\ud83d\ude97 Viv\u00ed: Escenarios inmersivos en Realidad Virtual que te muestran de forma real los riesgos de conducir sin responsabilidad.\n\n\ud83d\ude97  Aprend\u00e9: Transform\u00e1 la experiencia en conciencia, ideal para capacitaciones, campa\u00f1as y programas educativos."}]}, "developer_name": "Soukai", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://souls.soukai.com.ar/politicas/privacy_policy_en", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://souls.soukai.com.ar/politicas/terms_en", "publisher_name": "FourPlayers VR", "support_website_url": "https://fourplayersvr.com/", "website_url": "https://fourplayersvr.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "514087707868786"}, {"id": "1043107547362485"}], "external_subscription_type": "REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "